{"slug":"stock","name":"주식 떡상 게임","keywords":["주식","스톡","stock","stonks","떡상","주가","트레이딩","차트 게임","코인 차트","캐시아웃"],"prompt":"주식 오르는 게임을 만들어줘. 차트에서 화살표가 계속 내려가다가 누르고 있으면 올라간다. 초록 바에 닿으면 2배 점프, 빨간 바에 닿으면 2배 하락. 시드머니 1,000원으로 시작해 팔기 버튼으로 수익을 확정한다.","description":"차트 위 화살표를 조종하는 주식 게임이에요. 누르고 있으면 주가가 오르고 떼면 떨어지며, 초록 바(×2)를 먹고 빨간 바(÷2)를 피해 시드 ₩1,000을 ₩1,000,000으로 불린 뒤 팔기 버튼으로 수익을 확정하면 클리어! 파산(₩1 미만) 주의. PC 키보드(스페이스)·모바일 터치 홀드 모두 지원합니다.","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n<title>떡상 주식왕</title>\n<style>\n  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}\n  html,body{width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#0b0b0f;touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;\n    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#fff}\n  canvas{display:block;position:fixed;inset:0}\n  #cashout{position:fixed;left:18px;bottom:20px;z-index:20;display:none;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n    padding:14px 22px;border:none;border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ef4444,#b91c1c);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;\n    box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(239,68,68,.45),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25)}\n  #cashout:active{transform:scale(.96)}\n  #cashout.ready{animation:pulse 1s infinite}\n  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(34,197,94,.5)}50%{box-shadow:0 6px 34px rgba(34,197,94,.95)}}\n  .ov{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:30;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(8,8,12,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}\n  .ov.hidden{display:none}\n  .card{width:min(420px,88vw);text-align:center;background:rgba(20,20,28,.92);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);\n    border-radius:22px;padding:30px 26px;box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}\n  .card h1{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin-bottom:8px}\n  .card .sub{color:#a1a1aa;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .rules{text-align:left;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:#d4d4d8;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);\n    border-radius:14px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .big{font-size:38px;font-weight:900;margin:6px 0 2px}\n  .green{color:#22c55e}.red{color:#ef4444}\n  .best{font-size:12px;color:#71717a;margin-top:10px}\n  .btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;padding:14px 34px;border:none;border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer;\n    font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#22c55e,#15803d);\n    box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(34,197,94,.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.3)}\n  .btn:active{transform:scale(.96)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<button id=\"cashout\">💰 팔기 <span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;opacity:.85\">Cash Out</span></button>\n\n<div class=\"ov\" id=\"ov-title\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h1>📈 떡상 주식왕</h1>\n    <div class=\"sub\">시드머니 <b style=\"color:#fff\">₩1,000</b> 으로 시작 —<br><b class=\"green\">₩1,000,000</b> 을 만들어 팔면 승리!</div>\n    <div class=\"rules\">\n      🖱️ <b>누르고 있으면 상승</b>, 떼면 하락<br>\n      🟩 초록 바 = 가격 <b class=\"green\">×2</b> + 점프<br>\n      🟥 빨간 바 = 가격 <b class=\"red\">÷2</b> 폭락<br>\n      💰 <b>팔기</b> 버튼으로 언제든 수익 확정<br>\n      ⚠️ ₩1 밑으로 떨어지면 파산!\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn\" id=\"vibrex-start\" data-vibrex-role=\"start\">게임 시작</button>\n    <div class=\"best\" id=\"best-title\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ov hidden\" id=\"ov-over\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h1 id=\"over-h1\">💰 매도 완료!</h1>\n    <div class=\"sub\" id=\"over-sub\"></div>\n    <div class=\"big\" id=\"over-num\"></div>\n    <div class=\"best\" id=\"best-over\"></div>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-vibrex-role=\"restart\" id=\"btn-re1\">다시하기</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ov hidden\" id=\"ov-clear\" data-vibrex-role=\"clear\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h1>🚀 TO THE MOON!</h1>\n    <div class=\"sub\">₩1,000,000 달성 후 매도 성공 — 당신은 진정한 주식왕!</div>\n    <div class=\"big green\" id=\"clear-num\"></div>\n    <div class=\"best\" id=\"best-clear\"></div>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-vibrex-role=\"restart\" id=\"btn-re2\">다시하기</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n'use strict';\nvar cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');\nvar W=0,H=0;\nfunction resize(){var d=Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,2);W=window.innerWidth;H=window.innerHeight;\n  cv.width=W*d;cv.height=H*d;cv.style.width=W+'px';cv.style.height=H+'px';ctx.setTransform(d,0,0,d,0,0);}\nwindow.addEventListener('resize',resize);resize();\n\nvar SEED=1000,GOAL=1000000;\nvar phase='title',value=SEED,y=0,vy=0,hold=false,scroll=0,tPlay=0,spawnT=0,shake=0,lastAj=0,lastLv=0;\nvar bars=[],trail=[],pops=[],parts=[];\nvar botOn=false,botSkill=0.85,botReT=0;\nvar playerSkin=null;\nvar bestProfit=0;try{bestProfit=Number(localStorage.getItem('stonk-best'))||0;}catch(e){}\n\nfunction chart(){var m=Math.max(10,Math.min(W,H)*0.03);return{x:m,y:m,w:W-2*m,h:H-2*m};}\nfunction vmax(){return chart().h*0.62;}\nfunction spd(){return chart().w/4*Math.min(2,1+tPlay*0.018);}\nfunction ax(){var c=chart();return c.x+c.w*0.38;}\nfunction clamp(v,a,b){return v<a?a:v>b?b:v;}\nfunction fmt(v){v=Math.max(0,v);\n  if(v>=1e12)return '₩'+(v/1e12).toFixed(2)+'조';\n  if(v>=1e8)return '₩'+(v/1e8).toFixed(2)+'억';\n  if(v>=1e4)return '₩'+(v/1e4).toFixed(1)+'만';\n  return '₩'+Math.round(v).toLocaleString('ko-KR');}\nfunction progress(){return clamp(Math.log(Math.max(1,value)/SEED)/Math.log(GOAL/SEED),0,1);}\n\n// ── 오버레이 · 버튼 상태 ──\nvar $=function(id){return document.getElementById(id);};\nfunction setPhase(p){phase=p;\n  $('ov-title').classList.toggle('hidden',p!=='title');\n  $('ov-over').classList.toggle('hidden',p!=='over');\n  $('ov-clear').classList.toggle('hidden',p!=='cleared');\n  $('cashout').style.display=p==='playing'?'flex':'none';}\nfunction saveBest(profit){if(profit>bestProfit){bestProfit=profit;try{localStorage.setItem('stonk-best',String(Math.round(profit)));}catch(e){}}\n  var t='최고 수익: '+(bestProfit>0?'+'+fmt(bestProfit):'없음');\n  $('best-title').textContent=t;$('best-over').textContent=t;$('best-clear').textContent=t;}\nsaveBest(0);\n\nfunction reset(){var c=chart();value=SEED;y=c.y+c.h*0.42;vy=0;hold=false;scroll=0;tPlay=0;spawnT=0.4;shake=0;\n  bars=[];trail=[];pops=[];parts=[];lastAj=0;lastLv=0;}\nfunction start(){reset();setPhase('playing');if(window.AJ)AJ.start();}\nfunction restart(){if(window.AJ)AJ.restart();start();}\nfunction gameOver(bankrupt,soldValue){\n  var profit=soldValue-SEED;saveBest(profit);\n  if(bankrupt){$('over-h1').textContent='📉 파산...';\n    $('over-sub').textContent='주가가 ₩1 밑으로 떨어졌어요. 시드머니를 모두 잃었습니다.';\n    $('over-num').textContent='-'+fmt(SEED);$('over-num').className='big red';}\n  else{$('over-h1').textContent='💰 매도 완료!';\n    $('over-sub').textContent=fmt(soldValue)+' 에 전량 매도 — 시드 ₩1,000 대비';\n    $('over-num').textContent=(profit>=0?'+':'-')+fmt(Math.abs(profit));\n    $('over-num').className='big '+(profit>=0?'green':'red');}\n  setPhase('over');if(window.AJ)AJ.over(Math.round(Math.max(0,soldValue)));}\nfunction gameClear(soldValue){var profit=soldValue-SEED;saveBest(profit);\n  $('clear-num').textContent='+'+fmt(profit);\n  setPhase('cleared');if(window.AJ)AJ.clear(Math.round(soldValue));}\nfunction cashOut(){if(phase!=='playing')return;\n  if(value>=GOAL)gameClear(value);else gameOver(false,value);}\n\n$('vibrex-start').addEventListener('click',start);\n$('btn-re1').addEventListener('click',restart);\n$('btn-re2').addEventListener('click',restart);\n$('cashout').addEventListener('click',cashOut);\n\n// ── 입력: 누르면 상승 ──\nfunction setHold(on){hold=!!on;}\ncv.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(e){e.preventDefault();setHold(true);});\nwindow.addEventListener('pointerup',function(){setHold(false);});\nwindow.addEventListener('pointercancel',function(){setHold(false);});\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\n  if(e.key===' '||e.key==='ArrowUp'||e.key==='w'||e.key==='W'){e.preventDefault();\n    if(phase==='title')start();else if(phase==='playing')setHold(true);}\n  if(e.key==='Enter'&&(phase==='over'||phase==='cleared'))restart();});\nwindow.addEventListener('keyup',function(e){\n  if(e.key===' '||e.key==='ArrowUp'||e.key==='w'||e.key==='W')setHold(false);});\n\n// ── 바 스폰 · 충돌 ──\nfunction spawnBar(){var c=chart();var green=Math.random()<0.55;\n  var bw=c.w*(0.09+Math.random()*0.09),bh=Math.max(12,c.h*0.018);\n  bars.push({x:c.x+c.w+bw,cy:c.y+c.h*(0.12+Math.random()*0.76),w:bw,h:bh,green:green,hit:false});}\nfunction burst(x,yy,col,n){for(var i=0;i<n;i++){var a=Math.random()*Math.PI*2,s=60+Math.random()*180;\n  parts.push({x:x,y:yy,vx:Math.cos(a)*s,vy:Math.sin(a)*s,t:0.6+Math.random()*0.3,col:col});}}\n\n// ── 봇 (오토파일럿) ──\nwindow.vibrexBot={start:function(){botOn=true;botReT=0;},stop:function(){botOn=false;setHold(false);},\n  setSkill:function(s){if(typeof s==='number')botSkill=clamp(s,0,1);}};\nfunction botTick(dt){\n  if(phase==='title'){start();return;}\n  if(phase==='over'||phase==='cleared'){botReT+=dt;if(botReT>1.6){botReT=0;restart();}return;}\n  if(value>=GOAL){cashOut();return;}\n  var c=chart(),axx=ax(),look=c.w*0.5,near=null,i;\n  for(i=0;i<bars.length;i++){var b=bars[i];\n    if(b.hit||b.x+b.w<axx)continue;if(b.x-axx>look)continue;\n    if(!near||b.x<near.x)near=b;}\n  var want;\n  if(value<SEED*0.08){want=true;}\n  else if(near&&near.green){want=near.cy<y-8;}\n  else if(near&&!near.green){var gap=c.h*0.12;\n    want=near.cy<=y?false:true;\n    if(Math.abs(near.cy-y)>gap*2)want=y>c.y+c.h*0.5;}\n  else{want=y>c.y+c.h*0.45;}\n  if(Math.random()>botSkill)want=!want;\n  setHold(want);}\n\n// ── 아바타 프로토콜 ──\nfunction applyAvatar(det){if(det&&det.img){playerSkin=det.img;if(window.vibrexAvatarAck)window.vibrexAvatarAck();}}\nwindow.addEventListener('vibrex:avatar',function(e){applyAvatar(e.detail);});\nwindow.addEventListener('vibrex:avatar-remove',function(){playerSkin=null;});\nif(window.VIBREX_AVATAR)applyAvatar(window.VIBREX_AVATAR);\n\n// ── 매니페스트 ──\nwindow.VIBREX_GAME={\n  title:'떡상 주식왕',genre:'arcade',\n  goal:'시드 ₩1,000 을 굴려 ₩1,000,000 을 만든 뒤 팔기',\n  clearCondition:'가치가 ₩1,000,000 이상일 때 팔기 버튼을 누르면 클리어',\n  controls:[{input:'Space/터치 홀드',action:'누르고 있으면 주가 상승, 떼면 하락'},{input:'팔기 버튼',action:'수익 확정(매도)'}],\n  touchUI:'custom',\n  phase:function(){return phase;},\n  progress:progress,\n  state:function(){var c=chart(),axx=ax(),tg=null,dg=null,i;\n    for(i=0;i<bars.length;i++){var b=bars[i];if(b.hit||b.x+b.w<axx)continue;\n      if(b.green){if(!tg||b.x<tg.x)tg=b;}else{if(!dg||b.x<dg.x)dg=b;}}\n    var st={selfY:Math.round((y-c.y)/c.h*100)/100,\n      selfVY:Math.round(vy/vmax()*100)/100,\n      score:Math.round(value),progress:Math.round(progress()*100)/100};\n    if(tg){st.targetX=Math.round((tg.x-axx)/c.w*100)/100;st.targetY=Math.round((tg.cy-c.y)/c.h*100)/100;\n      st.targetDist=Math.round(Math.hypot(tg.x-axx,tg.cy-y)/c.w*100)/100;}\n    if(dg){st.dangerX=Math.round((dg.x-axx)/c.w*100)/100;st.dangerY=Math.round((dg.cy-c.y)/c.h*100)/100;\n      st.dangerDist=Math.round(Math.hypot(dg.x-axx,dg.cy-y)/c.w*100)/100;}\n    return st;},\n  start:start,restart:restart,\n  inputs:{action:function(on){if(phase==='title'&&on)start();else setHold(on);},\n    up:function(on){if(phase==='title'&&on)start();else setHold(on);},\n    action2:function(on){if(on)cashOut();}}\n};\n\n// ── 메인 루프 ──\nvar last=performance.now();\nfunction loop(now){var dt=Math.min(0.05,(now-last)/1000);last=now;\n  if(phase==='playing')update(dt);\n  draw(dt);requestAnimationFrame(loop);}\nfunction update(dt){var c=chart(),vm=vmax(),sp=spd(),axx=ax();\n  tPlay+=dt;scroll+=sp*dt;\n  if(botOn)botTick(dt);\n  var A=vm*3.2;\n  vy+=(hold?-A:A)*dt;vy=clamp(vy,-vm,vm);\n  y+=vy*dt;\n  var atBottom=false;\n  if(y<c.y+6){y=c.y+6;if(vy<0)vy=0;}\n  if(y>c.y+c.h-6){y=c.y+c.h-6;if(vy>0)vy=0;atBottom=true;}\n  var dir=clamp(-vy/vm,-1,1);\n  var rate=atBottom?-0.55:dir*0.85;\n  value*=Math.exp(rate*dt);\n  trail.push({s:scroll,y:y,d:dir});\n  while(trail.length&&axx-(scroll-trail[0].s)<c.x-40)trail.shift();\n  spawnT-=dt;\n  if(spawnT<=0){spawnBar();spawnT=(0.75+Math.random()*0.8)/Math.min(1.6,1+tPlay*0.012);}\n  for(var i=bars.length-1;i>=0;i--){var b=bars[i];b.x-=sp*dt;\n    if(b.x+b.w<c.x-60){bars.splice(i,1);continue;}\n    if(!b.hit&&axx>=b.x&&axx<=b.x+b.w&&Math.abs(y-b.cy)<b.h/2+11){\n      b.hit=true;bars.splice(i,1);\n      if(b.green){value*=2;vy=-vm*1.05;\n        pops.push({x:axx,y:y-24,txt:'×2 🚀',col:'#16a34a',t:1.1});\n        burst(axx,y,'#22c55e',16);}\n      else{value=Math.max(0.5,value/2);vy=vm*0.75;shake=9;\n        pops.push({x:axx,y:y+10,txt:'÷2 💥',col:'#dc2626',t:1.1});\n        burst(axx,y,'#ef4444',16);}\n      if(window.AJ)AJ.score(Math.round(value));}}\n  for(var j=pops.length-1;j>=0;j--){pops[j].t-=dt;pops[j].y-=30*dt;if(pops[j].t<=0)pops.splice(j,1);}\n  for(var k=parts.length-1;k>=0;k--){var p=parts[k];p.t-=dt;p.x+=p.vx*dt;p.y+=p.vy*dt;p.vy+=300*dt;if(p.t<=0)parts.splice(k,1);}\n  shake=Math.max(0,shake-30*dt);\n  lastAj+=dt;\n  if(lastAj>=1){lastAj=0;if(window.AJ)AJ.score(Math.round(value));}\n  var lv=Math.max(0,Math.floor(Math.log10(Math.max(1,value)/SEED)));\n  if(lv>lastLv){lastLv=lv;if(window.AJ)AJ.level(lv);}\n  $('cashout').classList.toggle('ready',value>=GOAL);\n  if(value<1)gameOver(true,0);}\n\nfunction rr(x,y2,w,h,r){ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x+r,y2);ctx.arcTo(x+w,y2,x+w,y2+h,r);\n  ctx.arcTo(x+w,y2+h,x,y2+h,r);ctx.arcTo(x,y2+h,x,y2,r);ctx.arcTo(x,y2,x+w,y2,r);ctx.closePath();}\n\nfunction draw(dt){var c=chart(),axx=ax();\n  ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);\n  ctx.fillStyle='#0b0b0f';ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\n  ctx.save();\n  if(shake>0)ctx.translate((Math.random()-0.5)*shake,(Math.random()-0.5)*shake);\n  // 차트 패널 (밝은 배경)\n  rr(c.x,c.y,c.w,c.h,14);ctx.fillStyle='#f7f7f8';ctx.fill();\n  ctx.save();rr(c.x,c.y,c.w,c.h,14);ctx.clip();\n  // 그리드\n  ctx.strokeStyle='#e4e4e7';ctx.lineWidth=1;\n  var g=Math.max(40,c.w/12),off=scroll%g;\n  for(var gx=c.x-off;gx<c.x+c.w+g;gx+=g){ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(gx,c.y);ctx.lineTo(gx,c.y+c.h);ctx.stroke();}\n  for(var gy=c.y;gy<c.y+c.h;gy+=g){ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(c.x,gy);ctx.lineTo(c.x+c.w,gy);ctx.stroke();}\n  // 바\n  for(var i=0;i<bars.length;i++){var b=bars[i];\n    ctx.shadowColor=b.green?'rgba(34,197,94,.55)':'rgba(239,68,68,.55)';ctx.shadowBlur=12;\n    rr(b.x,b.cy-b.h/2,b.w,b.h,b.h/2);\n    ctx.fillStyle=b.green?'#22c55e':'#ef4444';ctx.fill();ctx.shadowBlur=0;\n    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.85)';\n    ctx.font='700 '+Math.max(10,b.h*0.8)+'px system-ui,sans-serif';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.textBaseline='middle';\n    ctx.fillText(b.green?'×2':'÷2',b.x+b.w/2,b.cy+0.5);}\n  // 궤적\n  if(trail.length>1&&phase!=='title'){\n    ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.lineJoin='round';ctx.lineWidth=Math.max(4,c.h*0.008);\n    for(var t2=1;t2<trail.length;t2++){var p0=trail[t2-1],p1=trail[t2];\n      var x0=axx-(scroll-p0.s),x1=axx-(scroll-p1.s);\n      var col=p1.d>0.04?'#16a34a':p1.d<-0.04?'#dc2626':'#9ca3af';\n      ctx.strokeStyle=col;ctx.shadowColor=col;ctx.shadowBlur=8;\n      ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x0,p0.y);ctx.lineTo(x1,p1.y);ctx.stroke();}\n    ctx.shadowBlur=0;\n    // 화살촉\n    var ang=Math.atan2(vy,spd());\n    var hcol=vy<-vmax()*0.04?'#16a34a':vy>vmax()*0.04?'#dc2626':'#6b7280';\n    ctx.save();ctx.translate(axx,y);ctx.rotate(ang);\n    ctx.fillStyle=hcol;ctx.shadowColor=hcol;ctx.shadowBlur=10;\n    ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(16,0);ctx.lineTo(-8,-9);ctx.lineTo(-8,9);ctx.closePath();ctx.fill();ctx.shadowBlur=0;\n    ctx.restore();\n    // 아바타 스킨 — 화살촉에 탑승\n    if(playerSkin&&playerSkin.complete&&playerSkin.naturalWidth){\n      var sz=Math.max(34,c.h*0.055);\n      ctx.drawImage(playerSkin,axx-sz/2,y-sz-10,sz,sz);}}\n  // 파티클 · 팝업\n  for(var k=0;k<parts.length;k++){var pa=parts[k];\n    ctx.globalAlpha=Math.max(0,pa.t/0.7);ctx.fillStyle=pa.col;\n    ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(pa.x,pa.y,3,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();}\n  ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n  for(var j=0;j<pops.length;j++){var po=pops[j];\n    ctx.globalAlpha=Math.min(1,po.t);ctx.fillStyle=po.col;\n    ctx.font='900 '+Math.max(18,c.h*0.03)+'px system-ui,sans-serif';ctx.textAlign='center';\n    ctx.fillText(po.txt,po.x,po.y);}\n  ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n  ctx.restore();// clip 해제\n  // ── HUD ──\n  if(phase!=='title'){\n    // 현재 가치 알약\n    ctx.font='800 16px system-ui,sans-serif';ctx.textAlign='left';ctx.textBaseline='middle';\n    var vtxt='💰 '+fmt(value);var vw=ctx.measureText(vtxt).width+30;\n    rr(c.x+12,c.y+12,vw,38,12);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(24,24,27,.88)';ctx.fill();\n    ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.fillText(vtxt,c.x+27,c.y+32);\n    // 손익 대형 숫자\n    var diff=value-SEED,up=diff>=0;\n    ctx.font='900 '+Math.max(26,Math.min(46,W*0.055))+'px system-ui,sans-serif';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.textBaseline='top';\n    ctx.fillStyle=up?'#16a34a':'#dc2626';\n    ctx.shadowColor=up?'rgba(22,163,74,.4)':'rgba(220,38,38,.4)';ctx.shadowBlur=10;\n    ctx.fillText((up?'+':'-')+fmt(Math.abs(diff)),c.x+c.w/2,c.y+14);\n    ctx.shadowBlur=0;\n    // 목표 진행바\n    var pw=Math.min(240,c.w*0.4),px=c.x+c.w/2-pw/2,py=c.y+14+Math.max(26,Math.min(46,W*0.055))+8;\n    rr(px,py,pw,7,3.5);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(0,0,0,.12)';ctx.fill();\n    if(progress()>0.01){rr(px,py,pw*progress(),7,3.5);ctx.fillStyle='#16a34a';ctx.fill();}\n    ctx.font='700 11px system-ui,sans-serif';ctx.fillStyle='#71717a';\n    ctx.fillText('목표 ₩100만',c.x+c.w/2,py+11);}\n  if(botOn){ctx.font='800 10px system-ui,sans-serif';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.textBaseline='middle';\n    var bw2=86,bx2=c.x+c.w-bw2-12;rr(bx2,c.y+12,bw2,20,10);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(37,99,235,.85)';ctx.fill();\n    ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.fillText('AI PLAYING',bx2+bw2/2,c.y+22);}\n  ctx.restore();}\nrequestAnimationFrame(loop);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}
